\text{-}null} \\vdash \\operatorname{Null}_\\mu(N)\\leftrightarrow \\exists X\\;\\exists\\mathcal F\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land N\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mu(N)=0\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Null set: set of measure zero</li>\n<li>Full measure: complement is null</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span>-almost everywhere: holds except on null set</li>\n<li>A Vitali set is nonmeasurable, so it is not a Lebesgue-null set.</li>\n<li>Null closed under countable union</li>\n<li>Measure-zero and meagerness are independent notions: a null set may be comeager, and a meager set may have positive measure.</li>\n<li>Almost-everywhere predicates are downstream atoms built from null sets.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Halmos, Measure Theory</li>\n<li>Rudin, Real and Complex Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-measure-space","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-measure-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measure-space","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)$ (measure-space predicate, see [[58-df-measure-space]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Null}_\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}null} \\vdash \\operatorname{Null}_\\mu(N)\\leftrightarrow \\exists X\\;\\exists\\mathcal F\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land N\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mu(N)=0\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false}],"bytes":1175,"backlinks":[{"id":"0e66edf771659db2","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Null}_\\lambda:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (Lebesgue-null compatibility predicate, see [[../batch12/58-df-null.md]])"},{"id":"f9dcb3365c965859","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal{N}$ (null ideal, see [[../batch12/58-df-null.md]])"},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-218","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-null]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-895","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-null.md|58-df-null]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["83a15c7e9b3817dc"]}